 "segments": [
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Inside the surveillance van parked outside the building, Major Lavrov monitors the ongoing sting operation while his handcuffed detainee Pavel grows impatient. Just as tensions peak, Lavrov receives an unexpected phone call from his wife Alla about dinner. Let's listen to the scene in Russian first; don't worry if you don't catch every word right away.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "Почему вы просто сидите здесь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "Нужно пойти туда и всё прекратить.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Спокойно, специальная операция продолжается.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "Отстегните меня, моя рука затекла.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Ты подождёшь, пока операция идёт.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Тихо! Мой телефон звонит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Алло, да, Алла Евгеньевна.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Нет, здесь никто не стонет.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Я скоро буду дома, дорогая.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Овощное рагу на ужин?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Да, конечно, это прекрасно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "А я могу пойти домой?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "Моя жена тоже очень волнуется.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Хорошо, идите скорее отсюда.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Now let's walk through the surveillance van scene line by line.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "Почему вы просто сидите здесь?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Why are you just sitting here?' Handcuffed inside the surveillance van, Pasha fumes at the agents for just sitting around.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "Нужно пойти туда и всё прекратить.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We need to go in there and stop everything.' Terrified that Arkady is telling Marina the truth on tape, he demands they storm in and stop it.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Спокойно, специальная операция продолжается.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Calm down, the special operation continues.' Lavrov waves him off calmly — the sting operation is still running.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "Отстегните меня, моя рука затекла.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Uncuff me, my hand has gone numb.' Switching tactics, Pasha complains that his cuffed wrist has gone completely numb.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Ты подождёшь, пока операция идёт.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You will wait while the operation goes on.' Lavrov tells him bluntly that he will sit tight until the mission wraps up.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Тихо! Мой телефон звонит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Quiet! My phone is ringing.' Suddenly Lavrov hushes the van because his own cell phone is ringing.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Алло, да, Алла Евгеньевна.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Hello, yes, Alla Yevgenyevna.' The tough major immediately goes soft, addressing his wife by her formal name and patronymic.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Нет, здесь никто не стонет.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, nobody is groaning here.' As Pasha groans in the background, Lavrov quickly reassures his wife that nobody is moaning in here.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Я скоро буду дома, дорогая.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will be home soon, darling.' Using a sweet pet name, he promises her he will be home for dinner soon.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Овощное рагу на ужин?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Vegetable stew for dinner?' Right in the middle of a high-stakes stakeout, he chats about having vegetable stew tonight.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Да, конечно, это прекрасно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Yes, of course, that sounds wonderful.' Like a dutiful husband, he tells her that vegetable stew sounds wonderful.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "А я могу пойти домой?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And can I go home?' Seizing on the domestic mood, Pasha sheepishly asks if he can go home too.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "pasha",
   "t": "Моя жена тоже очень волнуется.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'My wife is also very worried.' He pleads that his own wife is sitting at home worrying about him.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "lavrov",
   "t": "Хорошо, идите скорее отсюда.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Fine, go away from here quickly.' Softened up by his wife's call, Lavrov uncuffs Pasha and tells him to get lost. Now let's listen to the entire dialogue once again from start to finish.",
   "gap": 0.9
